[engl]
{100}{}{Theresa}
{200}{}{You see Theresa.}
{1000}{}{I didn't think you would succeed, but you did a good job. Thank you for saving us all.}
{1001}{}{Please hurry and find the water chip. We cannot wait much longer.}
{1002}{}{Welcome to our meeting! As you have been picked by the Overseer to go outside, perhaps
you can give us some advice before our move to the outdoors as well.}
{1003}{}{Hello,
---
. How fares your journey?}
{1004}{}{Oh, just go away! We don't need the help of one of the Overseer's pawns!}
{1005}{}{Thank you so much. I can see you're going to be a big help. Why don't you just leave?}
{1006}{}{Really? Considering our position, our lack of water, and the original purpose of this
Vault, why do you think that we should stay?}
{1007}{}{Well, considering that you have some experience with the outside, perhaps you have some
valuable points to make.}
{1008}{}{It's good to hear that. I knew that the outside world couldn't be as bad as everyone
says. I mean, our ancestors lived outside, right? But that paranoid Overseer won't let
us leave.}
{1009}{}{Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. I hope that you're able to find the chip soon.}
{1010}{}{Hmm. I suppose it was too much to hope that the outside world had taught you to
communicate. Oh well.}
{1011}{}{It's only a matter of time before we run out of water here. But the Vault was never
meant to keep people inside forever! We have the people and the supplies to move outside
now. We have a better chance.}
{1012}{}{If you can't give us good reasons why we shouldn't leave, then we're not going to wait
here and die of water poisoning. Please don't get in our way.}
{1013}{}{We're well-prepared now. We have equipment and simulator training. A few hazards outside
are better than dying slowly of thirst!
---
Hmm. Perhaps you're right. There are probably other survivors out there, and they could
be hostile, too. I guess we will need to wait for everyone else to be ready.}
{1014}{}{And I suppose he chose you to go outside because he knew that you were under his thumb!
He really just doesn't want to give up his control over us.}
{1015}{}{Hmm. From what I've read, the outside isn't really all that dangerous. But I suppose
that you would know better than I, wouldn't you?}
{1016}{}{I knew that the outside couldn't be too bad. That's why I've been trying to convince
some people to come outside with me. I think that we have a better chance of survival
out there.}
{1017}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Theresa02a']}
{1018}{}{We've been over this before. Leave us alone.}
{1019}{}{Oh, come on! Wake up! If he thinks the outside is so dangerous, then how come he sent
you out there? The man just has a control complex. You're a stupid tool and you don't
even know it!}
{1020}{}{Oh, get real! Do you really think that we can live in this Vault generation after
generation? Maybe you can find a new chip, but what happens when the next thing breaks
down? And the next?}
{1021}{}{A lot of us think so. That's why we're planning to take some supplies and head out in a
few days. Say, do you have any advice for us?}
{1022}{}{I suppose. I always figured that he just had some sort of power trip. But I guess that
he wouldn't be the Overseer if he wasn't really concerned about our welfare, would he? I
guess we should just wait and see if you can find the chip.}
{1023}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'UpReact']}
{1024}{}{Okay. Well, thanks.}
