{1032}{}{Don't worry, I will.}
{1033}{}{Hoooot!}
{1034}{}{Hoooot!}
{1035}{}{Don't drink glowing water.}
{1036}{}{Yeah . . . don't go.}
{1037}{}{I think that your plans to leave are ill-advised.}
{1038}{}{It's going pretty well, thanks.}
{1039}{}{Not very well.}
{1040}{}{Hoogh!}
{1041}{}{[Done.]}
{1042}{}{Fine then.}
{1043}{}{Sorry, I'm here to hear all of this.}
{1044}{}{It's just a bad idea, is all.}
{1045}{}{The outside world is too dangerous to the unprepared. It's best to have time to make
proper preparations before going. The Overseer is trying to give the Vault that needed
time.}
{1046}{}{I just need a little more time to find the water chip.}
{1047}{}{The outside is too dangerous and hostile. You wouldn't last long.}
{1048}{}{The Overseer probably has his reasons.}
{1049}{}{Actually, it's pretty bad out there.}
{1050}{}{You're right; the outside world isn't all that bad.}
{1051}{}{The Overseer is simply trying to protect us. The outside world is dangerous to the
unprepared.}
{1052}{}{With all of the hazards I've been running in to, it may take some time.}
{1053}{}{Shouldn't be a problem.}
{1054}{}{[Done.]}
{1055}{}{Outside is too dangerous.}
{1056}{}{The Vault was made to release its inhabitants together as a group, not as a small band
that will be quickly overwhelmed.}
{1057}{}{Very well. It's your choice.}
{1058}{}{Sorry, folks, I can't let you do this.}
{1059}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Theresa25]}
{1060}{}{Well, good luck then.}
{1061}{}{Sorry, I can't let you leave now.}
{1062}{}{Actually, I think he believes that there's no reason to risk survival outside while it's
still safe in here.}
{1063}{}{I resent that remark!}
{1064}{}{[Done.]}
{1065}{}{What are you smoking!?}
{1066}{}{That's probably a good idea.}
{1067}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Theresa08]}
