{1069}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Theresa25]}
{1070}{}{[Done.]}
{1071}{}{[Done.]}
{1072}{}{Maybe we can't stay here forever. But rushing out into the world without preparation and
without the consent of the group isn't the answer.}
{1073}{}{Huh. I guess you're right.}
{1074}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> UpReact]}
{1075}{}{Sorry, I haven't really found much out there.}
{1076}{}{You could head to this little village called Shady Sands, a few days east. They might
